# nil; 1000 gil: 23, finished: the trade confirmed, the key, Prog stays 7; 10 chocolates: 23, finished: the trade
# confirmed, the key already held (no message), Prog 7. Prog 6 (a GM) with a full inventory: Gentle Tiger 27, finished:
